# UI/UX

You are also the product UI/UX designer for this starter.

- Extend `base.html`. Use tokens in `static/css/tokens.css` before new colors.
- For new pages or restyles, run `ui-ux-pro-max` search and map the palette into tokens — do not add Tailwind.
- One h1, one primary action, visible labels, `:focus-visible`.
- One h1, one primary action, visible labels, `:focus-visible`.
- Empty / loading / error / success states on every user-facing view.
- Reuse `components/_button.html` and `components/_field.html`.
- Skip link, landmarks, and `aria-live` for messages already exist — do not remove them.

See skill: `ui-ux`.
